{"ID":"20240205153722-eeygkiy","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153722-eeygkiy","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153722-eeygkiy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206135229-26s3jny\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240221194155-w26g8ow\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1406,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240221194155-w26g8ow\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"苦楝皮","type":"doc","updated":"20240902161539"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206135229-26s3jny","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206135229-26s3jny","updated":"20240206135242"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产四川、贵州、湖北、河南等地。\n【性状】\t根皮：呈不规则条块、片状或槽状，长短宽窄不一，厚约36mm。外表面灰褐色或灰棕色，皮孔大而明显，有不规则的纵裂深沟纹，木栓层常作鳞片状，衰老的栓皮常剥落。露出砖红色的内皮；内表面淡黄色有细纵纹。质坚韧，不易折断。断面纤维成层，可层层剥离，剥下的薄片，有极细的网纹。气微弱，味极苦。树皮：呈槽形的片状或长卷筒状。长短不一，长约30100cm，宽310cm，厚37mm，外表面灰褐色或灰棕色，较平坦，有多数纵向裂纹及横向延长的皮孔。内表面白色或淡黄色。质坚脆，易折断，断面纤维性层片状。气味与根皮同。\n【性味】\t苦，寒，有毒。\n【功效】\t清热，燥湿，杀虫。治蛔虫，蛲虫，风疹，疥癣。"}]},{"ID":"20240206135232-mzl0nee","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206135232-mzl0nee","updated":"20240206135232"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206135232-m1wje1r.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205162422-lrw7eqm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205162422-lrw7eqm","updated":"20240205162422"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"苦楝皮"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/苦楝皮-20240205162422-mmespp4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240902161504-urfgxky","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902161504-urfgxky","updated":"20240902161504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 378px;","style":"width: 368px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"楝实"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/楝实-20240826145600-rqhxv87.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 368px;\" parent-style=\"width: 378px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 460px;","style":"width: 450px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"楝实 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/楝实 1-20240826145648-ri4p3zw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 450px;\" parent-style=\"width: 460px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240902161504-l1x1be1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902161504-l1x1be1","updated":"20240902161504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 229px;","style":"width: 219px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"楝实12"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/楝实12-20240702122543-ygaww6e.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 219px;\" parent-style=\"width: 229px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 333px;","style":"width: 323px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"}